# GDOS: Easy Draw 2.35 (ST Review's cover disk) and its OUTPRINT, printing a
# drawing through GDOS and the FX-80 driver (GEMSYS\FX80.SYS, ASSIGN.SYS). GDOS
# loads from the boot disk's AUTO folder, so drive A is a work copy of the
# whole disk whose DESKTOP.INF/NEWDESK.INF autostart A:\EASYDRAW.PRG in medium
# resolution (make_launcher.py --inf-only, disk_copy.py --put). Positions are
# medium resolution's.
@printer
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/easydraw.st
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 2500
# the first click after boot is lost: an empty spot first
mouse 400 150
click left 2
wait 25
# File > OUTPRINT..., don't save
mouse 87 5
wait 25
mouse 124 87
click left 2
wait 200
mouse 347 127
click left 2
wait 800
shot outprint
# Edit > Add Name (Alt A): DRAWINGS\HOUSE.GEM
keydown 0x38
key a
keyup 0x38
wait 150
mouse 244 105
click left 2
wait 150
key 0x01
type house.gem
key 0x1c
wait 150
shot listed
# File > Start Outprint (Ctrl P)
keydown 0x1d
key p
keyup 0x1d
wait 300
shot start
# Device: Printer (the default), OK
printwatch
mouse 455 129
click left 2
printer 1000 60000
shot printed
